  "factor_name": "VIX-conditioned range-expansion reversal",
  "version": "2027-03-25.v1",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "clip(-(ret_3d/(std(ret_1d,15)*sqrt(3))) * (1+0.5*max(0,mean(range_5)/median(range_30)-1)) * (1+0.35*VIX_percentile_252), -12, 12)",
    "description": "Fade standardized three-day asset returns. Increase reversal exposure when the asset's recent intraday range expands versus its 30-observation median and when observation-only VIX is elevated in its trailing 252-day percentile. VIX is lagged through the prior completed observation and is never traded. NaNs are retained when dependencies are unavailable."
